#: ../../source/codebase-inspection_SKILL.md:112
msgid ""
"**Always exclude .git, node_modules, venv** — without `--folders-to-"
"skip`, pygount will crawl everything and may take minutes or hang on "
"large dependency trees."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/codebase-inspection_SKILL.md:113
msgid ""
"**Markdown shows 0 code lines** — pygount classifies all Markdown content"
" as comments, not code. This is expected behavior."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/codebase-inspection_SKILL.md:114
msgid ""
"**JSON files show low code counts** — pygount may count JSON lines "
"conservatively. For accurate JSON line counts, use `wc -l` directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/codebase-inspection_SKILL.md:115
msgid ""
"**Large monorepos** — for very large repos, consider using `--suffix` to "
"target specific languages rather than scanning everything."
msgstr ""

